        },
        "quote": "(a) Any diversion agreement entered into in lieu of further criminal proceedings on a complaint alleging a violation of a City ordinance shall include: (1) the defendant’s full name; (2) the defendant’s full name at the time the complaint was filed, if different from the defendant’s current name; (3) the defendant’s sex, race and date of birth; (4) the crime with which the defendant is charged; (5) the date the complaint was filed; and (6) the Municipal Court with which the agreement is filed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.460:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
