          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 927,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.460:block:1",
          "start": 499
        },
        "quote": "(b) The City Attorney shall forward to the Kansas Bureau of Investigation a copy of a diversion agreement entered into by the City Attorney only when required by rules and regulations adopted by the Director of the Bureau pursuant to K.S.A. 22-4704 and amendments thereto. The copy of the agreement shall be made available upon request to any county, district or city attorney who subsequently considers diversion of the person.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.460:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
