          "start": 928
        },
        "quote": "(c) As used in this section, “complaint” includes a citation or notice to appear. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 48, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-83. Formerly 2.110.460.)",
